{"material_id": "ntce.chuzhong.tiyu.2017b.q32.material.recovered", "text": "初一年级女生上体育课，学习排球的垫球技术（第一次课）。任课教师李老师先让学 生进行自由拍击练习作为准备活动。到了课的基本部分，他要求学生进行自抛自垫练习。 练习一段时间后，李老师把学生集中起来说：“同学们垫球时手臂都伸得很直，很好！如 果能把球抛得高一点就更好了！”听了他的话后，同学们纷纷把球抛得越来越高……", "source_files": [{"path": "教资/真题/初中真题/2017年下半年教师资格证考试《初中体育与健康》题.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "c571a19c71c6f7798edb2bd8c2a89c16a8a7d1de324506324e046d10ab4eee73", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 2641, "decoded_csv_character_end": 2797, "next_source_question_number": 39, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/初中真题/2017年下半年教师资格证考试《初中体育与健康》题.csv", "role": "question_raw", "locator": {"paper_order": 32, "alignment_status": "pending"}, "sha256": "c571a19c71c6f7798edb2bd8c2a89c16a8a7d1de324506324e046d10ab4eee73"}], "review": {"content_verified": false, "status": "auto_parsed", "extraction_status": "source_interval_recovered_pending_expert"}, "question_ids": ["ntce.chuzhong.tiyu.2017b.q32"], "knowledge_node_ids": ["ntce.chuzhong.tiyu.s1.k08", "ntce.chuzhong.tiyu.s1.k11", "ntce.chuzhong.tiyu.s2.k02"], "ability_ids": ["ntce.chuzhong.ability.subject", "ntce.chuzhong.ability.theory"], "exam_requirement_ids": ["ntce.outline.313.r004", "ntce.outline.313.r007", "ntce.outline.313.r011", "ntce.outline.313.r016", "ntce.outline.313.r017", "ntce.outline.313.r018", "ntce.outline.313.r028"], "used_by_questions": ["ntce.chuzhong.tiyu.2017b.q32"], "word_count": 155, "level": "chuzhong", "subject": "tiyu", "kind": "case_material", "source": {"origin_file": "教资/真题/初中真题/2017年下半年教师资格证考试《初中体育与健康》题.csv", "files": [{"path": "教资/真题/初中真题/2017年下半年教师资格证考试《初中体育与健康》题.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "c571a19c71c6f7798edb2bd8c2a89c16a8a7d1de324506324e046d10ab4eee73", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 2641, "decoded_csv_character_end": 2797, "next_source_question_number": 39, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/初中真题/2017年下半年教师资格证考试《初中体育与健康》题.csv", "role": "question_raw", "locator": {"paper_order": 32, "alignment_status": "pending"}, "sha256": "c571a19c71c6f7798edb2bd8c2a89c16a8a7d1de324506324e046d10ab4eee73"}], "type": "真题", "copyright": {"authorization_status": "unknown", "holder": null, "use_scope": "research_non_commercial", "expires_at": null, "source_nature": "official_exam", "nature_note": "教育主管部门公开发布的考试试题", "nature_evidence": "filename_pattern:官方真题命名", "attribution_required": false}}}
{"material_id": "ntce.chuzhong.tiyu.2017b.q33.material.recovered", "text": "在跳远教学中，常以跳远成绩评价学生的学习效果，致使一部分运动能力相对较差 的学生产生自卑心理。为了激发学习动机，获得成功体验，使每个学生都能享受到体育 学习的乐趣，进而向新的目标挑战。教师先测出每个学生跳远的最好成绩（见图 1），然 后在最近落点处横放一条绳，作为“目标绳”，以各自最好成绩从“目标绳”开始反方向 （助跑方向）测量出起跳点，每个学生从各自起跳点起跳，以距离“目标绳”的远近来评 价每个学生的练习效果（见图 2）。", "source_files": [{"path": "教资/真题/初中真题/2017年下半年教师资格证考试《初中体育与健康》题.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "c571a19c71c6f7798edb2bd8c2a89c16a8a7d1de324506324e046d10ab4eee73", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 2867, "decoded_csv_character_end": 3081, "next_source_question_number": 40, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/初中真题/2017年下半年教师资格证考试《初中体育与健康》题.csv", "role": "question_raw", "locator": {"paper_order": 33, "alignment_status": "pending"}, "sha256": "c571a19c71c6f7798edb2bd8c2a89c16a8a7d1de324506324e046d10ab4eee73"}], "review": {"content_verified": false, "status": "auto_parsed", "extraction_status": "source_interval_recovered_pending_expert"}, "question_ids": ["ntce.chuzhong.tiyu.2017b.q33"], "knowledge_node_ids": ["ntce.chuzhong.tiyu.s1.k04", "ntce.chuzhong.tiyu.s3.k03", "ntce.chuzhong.tiyu.s4.k02"], "ability_ids": ["ntce.chuzhong.ability.design", "ntce.chuzhong.ability.evaluate", "ntce.chuzhong.ability.manage", "ntce.chuzhong.ability.subject"], "exam_requirement_ids": ["ntce.outline.313.r004", "ntce.outline.313.r017", "ntce.outline.313.r018", "ntce.outline.313.r020", "ntce.outline.313.r029"], "used_by_questions": ["ntce.chuzhong.tiyu.2017b.q33"], "word_count": 214, "level": "chuzhong", "subject": "tiyu", "kind": "case_material", "source": {"origin_file": "教资/真题/初中真题/2017年下半年教师资格证考试《初中体育与健康》题.csv", "files": [{"path": "教资/真题/初中真题/2017年下半年教师资格证考试《初中体育与健康》题.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "c571a19c71c6f7798edb2bd8c2a89c16a8a7d1de324506324e046d10ab4eee73", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 2867, "decoded_csv_character_end": 3081, "next_source_question_number": 40, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_