{"material_id": "ntce.chuzhong.tiyu.2017b.q34.material.recovered", "text": "场地：200m 田径场一块。器材：足球20 个、标志杆25 个、跳绳20 个、手提式体操垫20 个、跨栏架20 个、球框4 个。设计要求：含有足球元素，以发展学生体能为目的，合理选用提供的场地、器材，游戏内容不少于3 种形式。依据提供的表格格式作答。", "source_files": [{"path": "教资/真题/初中真题/2017年下半年教师资格证考试《初中体育与健康》题.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "c571a19c71c6f7798edb2bd8c2a89c16a8a7d1de324506324e046d10ab4eee73", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 3160, "decoded_csv_character_end": 3285, "next_source_question_number": 41, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/初中真题/2017年下半年教师资格证考试《初中体育与健康》题.csv", "role": "question_raw", "locator": {"paper_order": 34, "alignment_status": "pending"}, "sha256": "c571a19c71c6f7798edb2bd8c2a89c16a8a7d1de324506324e046d10ab4eee73"}], "review": {"content_verified": false, "status": "auto_parsed", "extraction_status": "source_interval_recovered_pending_expert"}, "question_ids": ["ntce.chuzhong.tiyu.2017b.q34"], "knowledge_node_ids": ["ntce.chuzhong.tiyu.s1.k02", "ntce.chuzhong.tiyu.s1.k04", "ntce.chuzhong.tiyu.s1.k05"], "ability_ids": ["ntce.chuzhong.ability.subject"], "exam_requirement_ids": ["ntce.outline.313.r004", "ntce.outline.313.r011"], "used_by_questions": ["ntce.chuzhong.tiyu.2017b.q34"], "word_count": 125, "level": "chuzhong", "subject": "tiyu", "kind": "lesson_plan_material", "source": {"origin_file": "教资/真题/初中真题/2017年下半年教师资格证考试《初中体育与健康》题.csv", "files": [{"path": "教资/真题/初中真题/2017年下半年教师资格证考试《初中体育与健康》题.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "c571a19c71c6f7798edb2bd8c2a89c16a8a7d1de324506324e046d10ab4eee73", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 3160, "decoded_csv_character_end": 3285, "next_source_question_number": 41, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/初中真题/2017年下半年教师资格证考试《初中体育与健康》题.csv", "role": "question_raw", "locator": {"paper_order": 34, "alignment_status": "pending"}, "sha256": "c571a19c71c6f7798edb2bd8c2a89c16a8a7d1de324506324e046d10ab4eee73"}], "ty